  "description": "After dying at the height of her youth while chasing her dream of becoming a singer, Jung Soo-yi has wandered the afterlife for twenty-five years. One day, she’s suddenly pulled into the body of Im Yu-na, a washed-up B-list celebrity who has just ended her own life. \n\nCould this be heaven’s way of granting her a second chance to fulfill the dream she never achieved? \n\nBut Yu-na’s life is a complete mess. A mother who sees her only as a cash machine, an agency CEO who treats her like a puppet, and the public’s scornful gaze calling her a “brainless celebrity.” Too bad for them, they picked the wrong person to mess with. \n\n“I’m Jung Soo-yi, the heavenly voice who once ruled Itaewon’s King Club, 007!” \n\nThen appears Kang Tae-hoon, CEO of Hwaja Entertainment and president of JC Group. After meeting Soo-yi’s piercing gaze, he says, “With eyes like that… you can do anything.” \n\nOn a stage where past regrets, present despair, and future ambition collide, her second act begins.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=844222), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13272618)",
